      "value": "@{5a4aaf7f758fa46d131cd36b|full_name}: This is intended to be a short-term solution to give people an idea of whose avatar might be causing performance issues, not to say exactly how performant said avatar might be.\n\nExposing the raw \"stats\" is much better than the current situation we have right now to me and it feels like it could be done relatively quick, until a better system can be made to replace it.",
